      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>Strix kinmates are tightly bonded to one another, adept at teamwork and supporting each other's attacks. If an enemy is within reach of both the kinmate and one other strix, that enemy is Off-Guard to all strix.</p>",
